      "text": "At {{p:FY0}}, scheduled debt maturities were {{m:maturity_year_1:FY0}} in year one, {{m:maturity_year_2:FY0}} in year two, {{m:maturity_year_3:FY0}} in year three, {{m:maturity_year_4:FY0}} in year four, {{m:maturity_year_5:FY0}} in year five, and {{m:maturity_after_year_5:FY0}} thereafter.",
      "citations": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "quantitative",
      "text": "Debt due within 24 months was {{m:debt_due_24m:FY0}}, or {{m:share_due_24m:FY0}} of total debt of {{m:total_debt:FY0}}.",
      "citations": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "quantitative",
      "text": "Near-term maturity cover at {{p:FY0}} was {{m:near_term_maturity_cover:FY0}}.",
      "citations": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "qualitative",
      "text": "During 2025, the company repriced its first-priority senior secured term loan facilities maturing in 2027 and 2028.",
      "citations": [
        {
          "chunk_id": "CCL-000081509726000007-0179",
          "quote": "reprice the outstanding principal amounts of our first-priority senior secured term loan facility maturing in 2027 and our first-priority senior secured term loan facility maturing in 2028"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "qualitative",
      "text": "During 2025, the company used proceeds from debt issuances and borrowings, together with cash on hand, to prepay certain notes and secured term loan facilities.",
      "citations": [
        {
          "chunk_id": "CCL-000081509726000007-0179",
          "quote": "we used proceeds from debt issuances and borrowings, together with cash on hand, to prepay the following debt instruments:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "qualitative",
      "text": "At {{p:FY0}}, the company was in compliance with applicable covenants under its debt agreements, although cross-default and cross-acceleration clauses could cause substantially all outstanding debt to become due after an event of default.",
      "citations": [
        {
          "chunk_id": "CCL-000081509726000007-0183",
          "quote": "At November 30, 2025, we were in compliance with the applicable covenants under our debt agreements."
        },
        {
          "chunk_id": "CCL-000081509726000007-0183",
          "quote": "Generally, if an event of default under any debt agreement occurs, then, pursuant to cross-default and/or cross-acceleration clauses therein, substantially all of our outstanding debt could become due"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}

{
  "claims": [
    {
      "kind": "qualitative",
      "text": "A covenant breach under its debt instruments could trigger a default and cross-defaults, allowing creditors to accelerate or demand payment and leaving the company unable to repay its debt in full.",
      "citations": [
        {
          "chunk_id": "CCL-000081509726000007-0080",
          "quote": "If we breach the covenants or restrictions in our debt instruments, we could trigger a default"
        },
        {
          "chunk_id": "CCL-000081509726000007-0080",
          "quote": "Borrowings under our other debt instruments that contain cross-default provisions may also be accelerated"
        },
        {
          "chunk_id": "CCL-000081509726000007-0080",
          "quote": "our assets may not be sufficient to repay such indebtedness in full"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "qualitative",
      "text": "Fuel price volatility and supply disruptions could raise fuel costs and reduce profitability, weakening the operating cash flow available to service debt.",
      "citations": [
        {
          "chunk_id": "CCL-000081509726000007-0081",
          "quote": "may in the future experience increased volatility and lead to increased fuel costs and reduced profitability"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "qualitative",
      "text": "Overcapacity and competition in the cruise and land-based vacation industry may depress cruise sales and pricing, reducing cash generation needed to repay debt.",
      "citations": [
        {
          "chunk_id": "CCL-000081509726000007-0084",
          "quote": "Overcapacity and competition in the cruise and land-based vacation industry may negatively impact our cruise sales, pricing and destination options."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "qualitative",
      "text": "Geopolitical uncertainty, war, pandemics, inflation and higher interest rates could reduce travel demand and significantly weaken financial condition and operations, impairing cash flow.",
      "citations": [
        {
          "chunk_id": "CCL-000081509726000007-0068",
          "quote": "could lead to a decline in demand for cruises as well as have significant negative impacts on our financial condition and operations"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "qualitative",
      "text": "Evolving emissions regulations could force capital investment, emission-allowance purchases and other added costs that consume cash and reduce debt repayment capacity.",
      "citations": [
        {
          "chunk_id": "CCL-000081509726000007-0089",
          "quote": "requiring us to make capital investments in new equipment or technologies, pay for emission allowances"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}

{
  "claims": [
    {
      "kind": "quantitative",
      "text": "The SB grade is {{m:sb_grade:latest}} with a weighted score of {{m:sb_score:latest}}; the grade is not provisional because all six factors were scored, and the SB grade is a stylized internal scorecard grade, not a credit rating.",
      "citations": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "quantitative",
      "text": "The strongest scorecard factor is EBITDA / interest, which is {{m:interest_coverage:LTM}} and is in band {{m:band_interest_coverage:latest}} with the largest weight of {{m:weight_interest_coverage:latest}}.",
      "citations": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "quantitative",
      "text": "The weakest scorecard factor is near-term maturity cover, which is {{m:near_term_maturity_cover:FY0}} and is in band {{m:band_near_term_maturity_cover:latest}} with a weight of {{m:weight_near_term_maturity_cover:latest}}.",
      "citations": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "qualitative",
      "text": "The earlier findings support the scorecard outcome through Carnival's scale as the largest global cruise company with a portfolio of world-class cruise lines, and through the company's description of several years of exceptional performance that reduced debt, achieved strong profitability, surpassed the investment grade threshold and reinstated the dividend.",
      "citations": [
        {
          "chunk_id": "CCL-000081509726000007-0011",
          "quote": "We are the largest global cruise company, and among the largest leisure travel companies, with a portfolio of world-class cruise lines"
        },
        {
          "chunk_id": "CCL-000081509726000007-0016",
          "quote": "Several years of exceptional performance has significantly strengthened our financial fitness—reducing debt, achieving strong profitability and double‑digit ROIC, surpassing the investment grade threshold and reinstating our dividend."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "qualitative",
      "text": "The earlier risk findings temper the grade: overcapacity and competition may pressure pricing and destination options, fuel volatility and geopolitical or inflationary conditions could weaken cash flow, emissions rules could add costs, and covenant or cross-default features could leave the company unable to repay debt in full.",
      "citations": [
        {
          "chunk_id": "CCL-000081509726000037-0039",
          "quote": "Overcapacity and competition in the cruise and land-based vacation industry may negatively impact our cruise sales, pricing and destination options."
        },
        {
          "chunk_id": "CCL-000081509726000007-0081",
          "quote": "lead to increased fuel costs and reduced profitability"
        },
        {
          "chunk_id": "CCL-000081509726000007-0068",
          "quote": "geopolitical uncertainty, war and other military actions, pandemics, inflation, higher interest rates"
        },
        {
          "chunk_id": "CCL-000081509726000007-0089",
          "quote": "requiring us to make capital investments in new equipment or technologies, pay for emission allowances"
        },
        {
          "chunk_id": "CCL-000081509726000007-0080",
